      "evidence": "app.get('/search', ...)",
      "llm_reasoning": "The search endpoint lacks rate limiting, making it vulnerable to automated scraping or denial-of-service attacks via high-frequency requests.",
      "suggested_fix": "Implement express-rate-limit middleware to restrict the number of requests per IP address."
